  "interpretation": "<h3 data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"750\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"748\">Clinical Significance</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\" data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"912\">\n<p data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"823\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\">Detects <strong data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"788\">RET gene rearrangements</strong> seen in various cancers such as:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"912\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\" data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"867\">\n<p data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"867\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"865\">Papillary Thyroid Carcinoma (PTC)</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\" data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"912\">\n<p data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"912\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"910\">Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer (NSCLC)</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\" data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"998\">\n<p data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"998\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\">Helps in selecting <strong data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"956\">targeted therapies</strong> (e.g., RET inhibitors like Selpercatinib)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
